Description:
Directly use ``vmalloc()`` from kernel module. Allocate at __init and
free at __exit.


Parameter(of the module):
vm_buf_size:
        The number of pages to be allocated by vmalloc(), can be used
        in runtest.sh like ``insmod vmalloc.ko vm_buf_size=256``. On a
        system of 4kB pagesize, this will allocate 1mB non-contiguous
        memory.
